Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.95,0:00:30.49,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord0\blur32\t(0,349,\blur0)\t(2191,2540,\blur32}奪走我的全部
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.49,0:00:34.45,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord0\blur32\t(0,349,\blur0)\t(3611,3960,\blur32}疼痛、孤獨 一起吞噬掉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.96,0:00:50.80,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord0\blur32\t(0,349,\blur0)\t(4491,4840,\blur32}依舊沉寂在那一天裡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.80,0:00:56.60,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord0\blur32\t(0,349,\blur0)\t(5451,5800,\blur32}黑暗空虛的日子裡透進的光芒
