Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.31,0:01:01.35,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord0\blur32\t(0,349,\blur0)\t(2691,3040,\blur32}深海般的色彩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.60,0:01:03.44,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord0\blur32\t(0,349,\blur0)\t(1491,1840,\blur32}至今仍在胸口翻攪
