Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.86,0:01:13.07,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord0\blur32\t(0,349,\blur0)\t(1861,2210,\blur32}哪怕撕裂這幅軀體
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.07,0:01:17.50,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord0\blur32\t(0,349,\blur0)\t(4081,4430,\blur32}用那雙手 用那份欲望將我填滿
